The '''Ottelians''' ([[Ottelian language|Ottelian]]: 𐐄𐐻𐐻𐐯𐑊𐐫𐑅, ''Ottelõs'') are an ancient civilization located in [[Southern Meran]] and one of the greatest commercial, maritime, cultural, and military powers of [[Meran]] in Antiquity. Their capital and cradle was [[Dâmõpẽ]], in what is now [[Prugundy]]. 

